  "title": "TaskUs India Ranks in Top 10 Inspiring Workplaces Asia",
  "summary": "NEW DELHI, India — June 25, 2025 — TaskUs (Nasdaq: TASK), a leading provider of outsourced digital services and next-generation customer experience for the world’s most innovative companies, has been named No. 5 in the 2025 Top 10 Inspiring Workplaces in Asia by the Inspiring Workplaces Group (IWG). IWG evaluates companies across six core criteria: […]",
